## ObjectType: Entity Identifier

Local DEMO-ENTITY identifier linking one synthetic registry record to its entity; not an ISO 17442 registration.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| identifier_id | Identifier Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | identifier_id |
| entity_id | Entity Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | entity_id |
| synthetic_code | Synthetic Code | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | synthetic_code |
| scheme | Scheme | string | Declared identifier scheme, not the DEMO prefix of synthetic_code. Use the complete allowed scheme value. Allowed values: synthetic_entity_code. | scheme |
| is_synthetic | Is Synthetic | boolean | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | is_synthetic |

### Keys

Primary Keys: identifier_id
Display Key: synthetic_code
